# Binary assets must never go through line-ending conversion. Git's own binary
# detection already catches these, but this repo is worked on from Windows with
# core.autocrlf on, which warns on every one of them and would corrupt any file
# the heuristic ever got wrong. Declaring them is cheaper than finding out.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.stl binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
